sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant PodMigration
    participant RuntimeServiceStub
    participant FileSystem
    participant RemoteNode

    User ->> PodMigration: Start migration
    PodMigration ->> RuntimeServiceStub: ListPodSandbox
    RuntimeServiceStub -->> PodMigration: Return running pods
    PodMigration ->> RuntimeServiceStub: ListContainers (for selected pod)
    RuntimeServiceStub -->> PodMigration: Return container IDs

    PodMigration ->> RuntimeServiceStub: CheckpointContainer (each container)
    PodMigration ->> FileSystem: Save container and pod status
    PodMigration ->> RemoteNode: Transfer checkpoint data (SCP)
    PodMigration ->> RuntimeServiceStub: Stop and remove pod
    PodMigration ->> FileSystem: Clean up checkpoint directory
    PodMigration ->> User: Migration completed
